<p>Moula ke dar pe hoke pareshan aaye hai,<br>
Aafat rasida dukh zada hairaan aaye hai.</p>

<p>Shabbar ka wasta tumhe Shabbir ki qasam,<br>
Jaldi madad karo ke pareshan aaye hai.</p>

<p>Mushkil kushayi kijiye mushkil kusha hai aap,<br>
Maqsad ko apne lene ko is aan aaye hai.</p>

<p>Moula mohib hai apke jldi madad karo,<br>
Keeje ata sukoon pareshan aaye hai.</p>

<p>Ab dastagiri kijiye ya Shahe bekasa'n,<br>
Umeed war besaro samaan aaye hai.</p>

<p>Maqsad ko apne leke hi dar se uthenge hum,<br>
Hasrat liye hue hai pur armaan aaye hai.</p>

<p>Jo hum pe guzri aaj sunana hai apko,<br>
Qismat ka leke haath me diwaan aaye hai.</p>

<p>Ranjo alam ko dur karo jald Ya Ali,<br>
Apne ko karne ap pe qurbaan aaye hai..</p>